Version: @VERSION@
Section: text
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Local Print Maintainer <root@localhost>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), cups-filters | foomatic-filters, ghostscript (>= 9.0), dc, gawk | mawk
Recommends: cups, cups-client
Provides: printer-driver-foo2zjs
Conflicts: printer-driver-foo2zjs, printer-driver-foo2zjs-common
Replaces: printer-driver-foo2zjs, printer-driver-foo2zjs-common
Description: Dedicated HP LaserJet Pro CP1025/CP1025nw ZjStream driver
 Specialized foo2zjs printer driver for HP LaserJet Pro CP1025 / CP1025nw:
  - 1200x600 dpi 3-level hardware PWM {00, 10, 11} with CIE L* self-calibrated LUT
  - 600x600 dpi 1x1 micro-dot error diffusion (color and monochrome)
  - Pure-K neutral-axis GCR CMYK ICC profile for sRGB/GTK/browser printing
  - Manual long-edge and short-edge duplex printing
  - Self-describing per-page geometry to prevent non-A4 network paper tearing
